{"v":"2026-08-27","f":[{"i":"MNM1_a","n":"Papahanaumokuakea Marine National Monument expansion, West of the 180th Meridian","c":"USA","d":"Marine National Monument - Expansion Area","k":1,"l":4,"rf":2,"hl":3,"tr":3,"sp":3,"an":2,"en":2,"dv":3,"pu":"Papahānaumokuākea Marine National Monument, also known as the Northwestern Hawaiian Islands Coral Reef Ecosystem Reserve, was expressly created to protect an exceptional array of natural and cultural resources. On April 3, 2008, the Papahānaumokuākea Marine National Monument received final designat…","re":"The following activities are prohibited and thus unlawful for any person to conduct or cause to be conducted: 1. Entering the monument, with exceptions; 2. Exploring for, developing, or producing oil, gas, or minerals within the Monument; 3. Using or attempting to use poisons, electrical charges, or explosives in the collection or harvest of a Monument resource; 4. Introducing or otherwise releasing an introduced sp…","rn":"50 C.F.R. § 404; Presidential Proclamation 8031, as amended by Presidential Proclamations 8112 and 9478, 81 FR 60225 and 75382","rs":"","ma":"U.S. Fish and Wildlife Service; NOAA; State of Hawaii; Office of Hawaiian Affai…","se":"Year-round","u":"2026-06-19","pm":100,"b":[25.38975,177.84421,31.46832,180],"g":[[[[25.38975,180],[31.46832,180],[31.43883,179.93107],[31.41566,179.87929],[31.38371,179.81093],[31.35438,179.75091],[31.32896,179.70063],[31.29403,179.63434],[31.26365,179.57904],[31.23605,179.5304],[31.2078,179.48228],[31.17892,179.43468],[31.14941,179.38762],[31.10911,179.32572],[31.07577,179.27647],[31.03583,179.21962],[30.99258,179.16053],[30.95947,179.11692],[30.92082,179.06769],[30.87996,179.01751],[30.84496,178.97597],[30.79746,178.92158],[30.76121,178.88155],[30.71206,178.82922],[30.67459,178.79075],[30.62385,178.74053],[30.58523,178.70367],[30.53062,178.6534],[30.48887,178.61638],[30.44609,178.57972],[30.39301,178.53592],[30.35177,178.50314],[30.30946,178.47062],[30.25325,178.42907],[30